{"pin":"AB01526","subcodes":[{"code":"AB01526","anchor":"","first_line":"O Lord! Support every gathering formed for the exaltation of Thy Word of grace, and assist every company united in service to Thee [3.5s]... ...Verily, thou art the hearer of prayers, and verily, thou art powerful in all things. In this day, assemblies of consultation are of the greatest importance and a vital necessity. Obedience unto them is essential and obligatory. The members thereof must take counsel together in such wise that no occasion for ill-feeling or discord may arise","first_line_orig":"رب و موید کل جمع انعقد لاعلاء کلمه رحمانیتک و موفق کل عصبه اتفقت علی خدمه  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"320","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA16:215","source":"INBA16","locator":"215","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v016/?page=217"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA59:291","source":"INBA59","locator":"291","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v059/?page=293"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA88:285","source":"INBA88","locator":"285","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v088/?page=319"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA89:016b","source":"INBA89","locator":"016b","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v089/?page=19"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH2.035","source":"ADH2","locator":"035","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_2.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH2_1#18 p.030","source":"ADH2_1#18 p.030","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_2.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AMK.047-048","source":"AMK","locator":"047-048"},{"kind":"pu